{title: Come and Fill Me Up}
{song_number: 6}
{language: en}
{key: G}

{comment: Verse 1}
[G]I can feel You [Gsus4]flowing through [G]me.
[G]Holy Spirit, [Gsus4]come and fill me [G]up,
[D]come and [C]fill me [G]up. [Gsus4][G]

{comment: Verse 2}
[G]Love and mercy [Gsus4]fill my [G]senses.
[G]I am thirsty [Gsus4]for Your presence, [G]Lord.
[D]Come and [C]fill me [G]up. [Gsus4][G]

{comment: Pre-Chorus}
[Am7]Lord, let Your mercy [D]wash away [G]all of my [D/F#]sin. [Em7]
[Am]Fill me completely [D]with Your love [G]once a[Em7]gain. [D]

{comment: Chorus}
[C]I need You, [G]I want You, [C]I love Your [G/D][D]presence.
